IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. H2-OVERFLOW.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO 'input.dat' ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO 'output.dat' ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-DATA PIC X(1).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-DATA PIC X(1).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 DEST-N PIC 9(1).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
  ADD 1 TO DEST-N END-ADD
  DISPLAY DEST-N
STOP RUN.
